      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would maybe be useful if all players with moderators powers got a notification in-game when a moderation action is taken. Such as seeing when another moderator warns or kicks a user.\n\nMaybe also give moderators a notification when a vote-to-kick finishes, even if they themselves didn't vote in it.",
