  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-03-31T18:15:42.048Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently in VRChat logs, Instance Moderators can't see who they have kicked or issued warnings to. Often times, lobbies can be too busy to keep track of the moderation actions they need to log. Allowing Instance kicks and warnings to show in group, or the instance moderator logs will help keep track of this.",
